#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:1
msgid "FlexGate"
msgstr "FlexGate"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:3
msgid ""
"[FlexGate](https://flexgate.enilinx.com/) is an online sharing platform "
"where you can easily find or share your own Profiles, Iconpacks, Pages, "
"and Plugins."
msgstr ""
"[FlexGate](https://flexgate.enilinx.com/) はオンラインの共有プラットフォームで、"
"Profile、Iconpack、Page、Plugin を簡単に探したり、自分の作品を公開したりできます。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:5
msgid "Installing from FlexGate"
msgstr "FlexGate からインストールする"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:7
msgid "![1744946445046](image/flexgate/1744946445046.png)"
msgstr "![1744946445046](image/flexgate/1744946445046.png)"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:7
msgid "1744946445046"
msgstr "1744946445046"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:9
msgid ""
"Installing a Profile, Iconpack, Page, or Plugin from FlexGate is very "
"simple. Just make sure FlexDesigner is running, then click GET to "
"automatically download and install."
msgstr ""
"FlexGate から Profile、Iconpack、Page、Plugin をインストールするのはとても簡単"
"です。FlexDesigner を起動した状態で GET をクリックすれば、自動的にダウンロード"
"およびインストールされます。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:11
msgid "Uploading Profiles, Iconpacks, and Pages to FlexGate"
msgstr "Profile、Iconpack、Page を FlexGate にアップロードする"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:13
msgid "![1744946552525](image/flexgate/1744946552525.png)"
msgstr "![1744946552525](image/flexgate/1744946552525.png)"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:13
msgid "1744946552525"
msgstr "1744946552525"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:15
msgid "Go to your personal profile page and click on the item you want to upload."
msgstr ""
"個人用プロフィール ページを開き、アップロードしたい項目をクリックします。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:17
msgid "![1744946938052](image/flexgate/1744946938052.png)"
msgstr "![1744946938052](image/flexgate/1744946938052.png)"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:17
msgid "1744946938052"
msgstr "1744946938052"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:19
#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:38
msgid "Before uploading, you need to fill in some information:"
msgstr "アップロード前に、次の情報を入力する必要があります。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:21
msgid ""
"Title: The name of your content - keep it concise and clearly describe "
"its purpose"
msgstr ""
"Title: コンテンツの名前。簡潔に、目的が分かるように付けます"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:22
msgid ""
"Images: We recommend providing several screenshots to help users "
"understand what your content does"
msgstr ""
"Images: 内容が伝わるよう、複数のスクリーンショットを載せることをおすすめします"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:23
msgid "Category: Choose the most appropriate category for your content"
msgstr "Category: コンテンツに最も合うカテゴリを選びます"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:24
msgid "Operating System: Select which operating systems your content supports"
msgstr ""
"Operating System: 対応するオペレーティング システムを選びます"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:25
msgid ""
"Version: Your own version number for the content (unrelated to "
"FlexDesigner versions)"
msgstr ""
"Version: コンテンツ独自のバージョン番号（FlexDesigner のバージョンとは無関係）"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:26
msgid "Description: Detailed explanation of what your content does"
msgstr "Description: コンテンツの機能や内容を具体的に説明します"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:28
msgid "Uploading Plugins to FlexGate"
msgstr "Plugin を FlexGate にアップロードする"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:30
msgid "![1744946820834](image/flexgate/1744946820834.png)"
msgstr "![1744946820834](image/flexgate/1744946820834.png)"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:30
msgid "1744946820834"
msgstr "1744946820834"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:32
msgid ""
"Uploading a Plugin works slightly differently. We require Plugins to be "
"hosted on GitHub. Simply enter your repository URL, and FlexGate will "
"verify its validity."
msgstr ""
"Plugin のアップロードは少し手順が異なります。Plugin は GitHub 上にホストする"
"必要があります。リポジトリの URL を入力すると、FlexGate が有効性を確認します。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:34
msgid ""
"Make sure your repository was created with FlexCLI and has a valid plugin"
" structure. Check out the [SDK documentation](../sdk/index.rst) to learn "
"how to create custom plugins"
msgstr ""
"リポジトリが FlexCLI で作成され、正しい plugin 構造になっていることを確認して"
"ください。カスタム Plugin の作成方法は [SDK ドキュメント](../sdk/index.rst) を"
"参照してください"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:36
msgid "![1744946889859](image/flexgate/1744946889859.png)"
msgstr "![1744946889859](image/flexgate/1744946889859.png)"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:36
msgid "1744946889859"
msgstr "1744946889859"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:40
msgid ""
"Images: We recommend providing several screenshots to help users "
"understand what your plugin does"
msgstr ""
"Images: Plugin の動作が伝わるよう、複数のスクリーンショットを載せることを"
"おすすめします"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:41
msgid "Category: Choose the most appropriate category for your plugin"
msgstr "Category: Plugin に最も合うカテゴリを選びます"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:43
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:44
msgid "**Q: What is FlexGate?**"
msgstr "**Q: FlexGate とは何ですか？**"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:46
msgid ""
"**A:** FlexGate is an online sharing platform where you can easily find "
"or share your own Profiles, Iconpacks, Pages, and Plugins."
msgstr ""
"**A:** FlexGate はオンラインの共有プラットフォームで、Profile、Iconpack、Page、"
"Plugin を簡単に探したり、自分の作品を公開したりできます。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:48
msgid "**Q: Can I publish paid content through FlexGate?**"
msgstr "**Q: FlexGate で有料コンテンツを公開できますか？**"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:50
msgid ""
"**A:** The payment system is still under development. We plan to add this"
" feature in a future update."
msgstr ""
"**A:** 決済システムは現在開発中です。今後のアップデートで追加する予定です。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:52
msgid "**Q: Content uploaded to FlexGate infringes on my rights.**"
msgstr "**Q: FlexGate にアップロードされたコンテンツが私の権利を侵害しています。**"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:54
msgid ""
"**A:** We take intellectual property rights seriously. Please email "
"details of any infringing content to contact@eniacelec.com, and we will "
"address your concerns promptly."
msgstr ""
"**A:** 知的財産権には真摯に対応しています。侵害の疑いがあるコンテンツの詳細を "
"contact@eniacelec.com までメールでお知らせください。速やかに対応します。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:56
msgid "**Q: Where can I discuss and share with other creators?**"
msgstr "**Q: 他のクリエイターと情報交換・共有はどこでできますか？**"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:58
msgid ""
"**A:** We recommend joining our [Discord "
"community](https://discord.com/invite/7STSjmBpKT), where you'll find many"
" like-minded creators."
msgstr ""
"**A:** [Discord コミュニティ](https://discord.com/invite/7STSjmBpKT) への参加を"
"おすすめします。同じ志のクリエイターがたくさんいます。"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:60
msgid "**Q: How do I get customer support or submit suggestions?**"
msgstr "**Q: サポートを受けたり、提案を送ったりするには？**"

#: ../../source/troubleshoting/flexgate.md:62
msgid ""
"**A:** Please contact us at contact@eniacelec.com, or reach out directly "
"to administrators in our Discord community. We'll respond as soon as "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"**A:** contact@eniacelec.com までご連絡いただくか、Discord コミュニティの"
"管理者に直接お問い合わせください。できるだけ早く返信します。"

